  "title": "Slow Cooker Beef Pot Roast",
  "description": "This beef pot roast is Chef John&#39;s recipe for seared beef simmered with vegetables and herbs in a slow cooker until incredibly tender and flavorful.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
